r-to-forecast ratio):**\n1. **Candidate 3** — daily, about 1.15× on both goods. The best balance of shortages against storage.\n2. **Candidate 1** — daily, about 1.06×, matching the average multiplier.\n3. **Candidate 0** — every other day, about 1.1×.\n4. **Candidate 6** (about 1.0×, every other day) and **candidate 2** (exactly the forecast, daily) are close. Candidate 2 runs short often. I put 6 slightly ahead because it saves on fees.\n5. **Candidates 7 and 4** lose on the 1.3× over-order of good 0. Candidate 7 also orders about 1.2× of good 1, which is less harmful.\n6. **Candidate 5** — every third day, high storage."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4936, "cache_read_input_tokens": 886, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4936}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-29T08:14:57.292Z", "request_id": "req_011CgWCDZ48WkYW1TixYCWL3"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01SXDhEsRZc66Kwu1EKzZNif", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgWCDZRiNHKyo9ThAw4jv", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_01SXDhEsRZc66Kwu1EKzZNif", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.6, 0.72, 0.45, 0.75, 0.25, 0.12, 0.5, 0.35]}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input